    "created_by_user_sub": "a6c3f77e-d7e6-4b77-b249-70eb883abfa8",
    "created_timestamp": 1660865198492,
    "description": "This dataset contains raw instrument data and proteoform identifications results (primarily low mass < 20kDa) from laser micro-dissected kidney and pancreas tissue regions. The \"ID_search_results\" folder contains 3 tables. \"ProteoformSpectralMatch_TDportal_TopPIC_combined_*\" is the proteoform spectral matches with FDR cutoff 1%. \"TopPICR_*_Quant\" is the proteoform abundance table for each individual LCMS run (abundance not normalized, but similar spectral matches are clustered into groups). \"ProteoMatch_*\" is the annotated proteoform list related to the quantitation table, and is also used to match to MALDI data. Kidney dataset contains: glomerulus, medullary, and tubule. Pancreas dataset contains: islet and acinar regions. The \"extra\" folder contains the txt file for description of each LCMS run.",
